Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?HTDESIGNER-43:=20=E6=94=B9=E5=9B=9E=20DFM=20--?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20selected=20component(s)=20back=20to=20their=20.dfm=20v?=
 =?UTF-8?q?alues=20in=20one=20step=20(0.43.0)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Right-click 改回 DFM (or the palette), the properties panel's "這個元件全部改回
DFM" after its difference note, or "全部改回 DFM（N 個）" in the multi-select
section: every selected component gets back what its .dfm says -- position /
size, caption and look, exactly the differences the DFM list shows for them
-- as ONE source edit, so one Ctrl+Z takes it all back.
- lib/dfmdiff.resetItemsOf(rows): one setLayout per control (its differing
  sides merged) + one setLook / setCaption per property
- probe: editMany now also takes setLayout (layoutPlan: a locked or not
  movable one keeps its place and it is said, the others go on); when the
  selection was among them the panel is refreshed
- host: cmdResetToDfm (lookAll on the selection, diffPage, controls built by
  the page's JS left alone); the panel's resetToDfm message
- tests: lib (resetItemsOf), probe (a layout + a look change = one batch; a
  locked one keeps its place, said once), smoke (spbSave at 64 and bold ->
  one editMany {left 54, bold false}; the panel's button the same),
  panels_render (both buttons), real VS Code (spbSave back to the DFM in the
  source, ONE undo, no save).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
